cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, data, or model, please cite as below."
title: "Automatic Classification of Judo Technique from Video: An Industry-Academia Collaboration"
abstract: >-
  Video action recognition for classifying judo throws (sutemi_waza vs tachi_waza).
  MC3-18 temporal model with RGB-only input, evaluated with source-wise
  StratifiedGroupKFold cross-validation (leakage-free). Macro F1 = 0.787 ± 0.027
  (10 folds).
